R75	Addressee Arg1:T51 Arg2:T54	
T57	Quotation 6458 6595	"it is my business to know things. Perhaps I have trained myself to see what others overlook. If not, why should you come to consult me?"
R76	Cueing Arg1:T55 Arg2:T57	
R77	Speaker Arg1:T56 Arg2:T57	
R78	Addressee Arg1:T51 Arg2:T57	
T58	Quotation 6596 6981	"I came to you, sir, because I heard of you from Mrs. Etherege, whose husband you found so easy when the police and everyone had given him up for dead. Oh, Mr. Holmes, I wish you would do as much for me. I'm not rich, but still I have a hundred a year in my own right, besides the little that I make by the machine, and I would give it all to know what has become of Mr. Hosmer Angel."
R79	Addressee Arg1:T56 Arg2:T58	
R80	Speaker Arg1:T51 Arg2:T58	
T59	Quotation 6982 7036	"Why did you come away to consult me in such a hurry?"
