R107	Addressee Arg1:T64 Arg2:T77	
T78	Quotation 8633 8848	"Oh, no, sir. It is quite separate and was left me by my uncle Ned in Auckland. It is in New Zealand stock, paying 4 1/2 per cent. Two thousand five hundred pounds was the amount, but I can only touch the interest."
R108	Speaker Arg1:T75 Arg2:T78	
