T190	Cue 23556 23560	said
T191	Entity 23561 23567	Holmes
R277	Addressee Arg1:T191 Arg2:T186	
R278	Addressee Arg1:T191 Arg2:T188	
R279	Cueing Arg1:T190 Arg2:T189	
R280	Speaker Arg1:T191 Arg2:T189	
