R282	Cueing Arg1:T194 Arg2:T192	
R283	Cueing Arg1:T194 Arg2:T195	
R284	Speaker Arg1:T193 Arg2:T192	
R285	Speaker Arg1:T193 Arg2:T195	
T196	Quotation 23799 23822	"They are typewritten,"
