R307	Cueing Arg1:T211 Arg2:T209	
R308	Addressee Arg1:T206 Arg2:T209	
T212	Quotation 26488 26742	"Oh, that! I thought of the salt that I have been working upon. There was never any mystery in the matter, though, as I said yesterday, some of the details are of interest. The only drawback is that there is no law, I fear, that can touch the scoundrel."
R309	Addressee Arg1:T210 Arg2:T212	
R310	Speaker Arg1:T206 Arg2:T212	
